WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.240 --> 01:37.960
=Episode 7=

01:39.120 --> 01:40.599
Ninth Young Lady,
you're full of schemes,

01:40.599 --> 01:42.000
fully capable of handling
all this alone.

01:42.400 --> 01:44.000
Why drag me into this mess?

01:49.120 --> 01:50.200
Unmarried women

01:50.519 --> 01:52.359
can't navigate official social circles.

01:53.480 --> 01:54.879
I need a man by my side.

02:26.759 --> 02:28.000
Helping the Crown Prince with this case

02:29.080 --> 02:30.520
works in both our favor.

02:31.039 --> 02:32.000
Didn't you say

02:32.479 --> 02:34.280
you were tired of everyone
taking their cut?

02:34.840 --> 02:36.159
If we pull this off,

02:36.479 --> 02:37.759
we can clean up the salt trade

02:38.000 --> 02:40.159
and give the powerless somewhere
to turn.

02:40.159 --> 02:41.039
That's one reason.

02:43.919 --> 02:44.759
The other...

02:48.599 --> 02:49.960
I can earn some credit of my own

02:50.479 --> 02:52.039
and ask the Crown Prince
to give me a proper status.

02:52.680 --> 02:55.319
One that no one can simply decide
whether I live or die,

02:56.199 --> 02:57.080
or think they can

02:58.120 --> 02:59.680
take me as a concubine
whenever they please.

03:07.360 --> 03:08.120
Mr. Zhao,

03:08.560 --> 03:09.879
don't you want

03:10.639 --> 03:12.400
to become the real Jiuweijiao?

03:19.919 --> 03:21.439
That little wretch!

03:21.840 --> 03:23.319
Just wait till I get my hands on him.

03:23.319 --> 03:24.000
What happened?

03:26.319 --> 03:27.000
Master Zhao.

03:27.840 --> 03:30.560
That wretch Zhao played me!

03:30.560 --> 03:32.240
He turned me into his henchman!

03:32.759 --> 03:34.000
That scumbag.

03:34.159 --> 03:35.639
I'll cut him down myself!

03:43.479 --> 03:44.680
Who let you out?

03:44.680 --> 03:45.479
Perfect timing.

03:45.479 --> 03:45.759
I...

03:45.960 --> 03:47.960
He's our informant on this case.

03:48.199 --> 03:49.960
From now on, you two work together

03:49.960 --> 03:50.639
and watch each other's backs.

03:52.439 --> 03:54.400
Me? Work with him?

03:54.400 --> 03:55.280
Yes.

03:55.280 --> 03:56.080
Says who?

03:59.720 --> 04:01.080
(Linchun Station)

04:01.080 --> 04:02.039
Miss Fan.

04:02.719 --> 04:04.280
Madam wants to see you.

04:09.319 --> 04:10.439
What do we do, Miss Fan?

04:10.919 --> 04:12.000
This has gotten out of hand.

04:12.159 --> 04:13.080
Don't panic.

04:15.039 --> 04:16.720
Go get my trump card.

04:16.879 --> 04:17.480
Yes.

04:33.199 --> 04:34.759
What was in that wine
you gave me last night?

04:36.680 --> 04:38.199
I only had one cup,

04:38.800 --> 04:40.000
and I could barely keep my eyes open.

04:41.079 --> 04:42.439
There was all that commotion outside,

04:42.439 --> 04:43.079
and I slept through all of it.

04:45.399 --> 04:47.120
Young Master, you've got Miss Fan
all wrong.

04:47.360 --> 04:48.319
That wine

04:49.199 --> 04:50.360
came from Madam.

04:51.079 --> 04:52.800
She insisted Miss Fan

04:53.480 --> 04:55.480
put you and Ninth Young Lady Fu
together.

04:58.079 --> 04:59.199
Ninth Young Lady Fu?

05:02.920 --> 05:04.040
She's alive?

05:05.160 --> 05:06.199
Please don't be angry, Young Master.

05:07.879 --> 05:09.160
I knew you didn't want it,

05:10.160 --> 05:11.680
so I let her go.

05:17.800 --> 05:19.519
I know I've made a terrible mistake.

05:19.839 --> 05:21.120
I shouldn't have let her leave.

05:22.279 --> 05:24.120
But I couldn't go against your wishes

05:24.120 --> 05:25.480
and do something we'd both regret.

05:26.480 --> 05:28.240
If you truly have feelings for her

05:28.560 --> 05:29.920
and want her as your concubine,

05:30.399 --> 05:31.879
tell me now.

05:33.199 --> 05:34.680
I'll take the blame with Madam

05:34.959 --> 05:36.639
and ask her to call off our engagement.

05:36.639 --> 05:37.720
How could you think that?

05:39.279 --> 05:40.319
I never wanted that.

05:44.920 --> 05:46.439
Then that's all I needed to hear.

05:49.279 --> 05:50.800
Whatever Madam does to punish me,

05:51.319 --> 05:52.560
I'll accept it.

05:58.759 --> 05:59.360
Mother.

06:00.199 --> 06:01.240
How strange.

06:02.199 --> 06:03.959
I sent for Miss Fan.

06:05.040 --> 06:06.480
Why are you here instead?

06:09.079 --> 06:10.600
I had too much to drink last night.

06:11.959 --> 06:14.199
If Ninth Young Lady Fu
hadn't set her sights elsewhere,

06:14.279 --> 06:15.959
I imagine I would've woken up
this morning

06:17.839 --> 06:19.439
with someone else beside me.

06:23.079 --> 06:25.560
I underestimated that Miss Fan.

06:26.199 --> 06:28.920
A few words from her,
and she's turned you against me.

06:30.480 --> 06:32.160
All these years I've devoted to you,

06:32.160 --> 06:33.120
raising you, shaping you...

06:33.240 --> 06:34.319
Apparently it was all a mistake.

06:34.879 --> 06:35.680
Mother.

06:38.759 --> 06:40.879
After all this,
you still don't understand?

06:41.839 --> 06:43.839
Whatever came between us

06:43.839 --> 06:45.839
was never because of anyone else.

06:54.759 --> 06:55.519
How dare you!

06:56.399 --> 06:57.319
Her father taught you

06:57.319 --> 06:58.759
all those teachings of the sages

06:58.759 --> 07:00.480
so you could defy your own mother?

07:02.759 --> 07:03.920
But Master Fan

07:05.800 --> 07:07.720
was the tutor you chose for me.

07:08.680 --> 07:09.959
Even what I studied

07:10.079 --> 07:11.759
was decided by you.

07:12.920 --> 07:14.279
My whole life,

07:15.600 --> 07:17.639
you've made every decision for me.

07:18.000 --> 07:19.319
What I eat,

07:19.439 --> 07:20.560
what I wear,

07:20.680 --> 07:21.639
who I see,

07:21.639 --> 07:22.360
where I study...

07:22.360 --> 07:23.759
I've obeyed you in everything.

07:23.839 --> 07:25.560
But when it comes to marriage...

07:27.199 --> 07:29.079
I utterly detest the Ninth Young Lady,

07:29.079 --> 07:30.160
as you well know.

07:30.240 --> 07:31.680
Why must you choose her

07:31.680 --> 07:33.240
to stand before me and irk my eyes?

07:33.720 --> 07:35.519
Do you loathe her,
or loathe my decision?

07:37.879 --> 07:39.959
If I hadn't put so much effort into you,

07:40.199 --> 07:41.800
do you think
you'd be where you are today?

07:42.439 --> 07:43.920
Your character, your talent...

07:43.920 --> 07:45.680
What part of you was not shaped by me?

07:46.439 --> 07:47.879
And now, over some woman,

07:47.879 --> 07:49.120
you dare speak to me like this?

07:50.439 --> 07:51.879
That's ingratitude.

07:52.759 --> 07:54.720
Even your father
was never this heartless.

08:03.560 --> 08:04.399
What are you doing?

08:04.879 --> 08:05.920
When we left Huaying,

08:07.040 --> 08:08.279
you made me a promise, Mother.

08:08.759 --> 08:10.439
I choose whom I marry,

08:11.319 --> 08:12.399
and you decide my exams.

08:13.120 --> 08:14.680
But since you've broken your word,

08:15.639 --> 08:16.600
I suppose I don't need

08:16.759 --> 08:18.279
to go to the autumn provincial exam.

08:19.040 --> 08:20.360
I'll stay home instead

08:20.879 --> 08:22.000
and devote myself to you,

08:22.160 --> 08:23.439
like a dutiful son should!

08:23.439 --> 08:24.680
- What are you doing?
- Young Master!

08:24.680 --> 08:25.920
Young Master! What are you doing?

08:25.920 --> 08:26.600
Young Master!

08:26.720 --> 08:28.279
You can't hurt Madam!

08:29.480 --> 08:30.399
Jingxiu.

08:32.440 --> 08:33.519
My son.

08:34.600 --> 08:36.159
I'm your mother.

08:37.919 --> 08:40.120
The lotus seed and its pod are one.

08:41.759 --> 08:43.960
Do you really mean to shut me out?

08:44.639 --> 08:46.639
A seed only becomes a seed

08:48.080 --> 08:49.360
once it leaves the pod.

08:51.639 --> 08:53.039
If it stays trapped inside,

08:54.960 --> 08:56.440
it will never be more
than a part of the pod.

09:03.559 --> 09:05.080
Were you the one who dissolved the salt

09:05.240 --> 09:06.639
in water and handed it out

09:07.039 --> 09:07.679
to the people that day?

09:08.080 --> 09:08.960
It was me.

09:14.480 --> 09:15.080
Good.

09:15.919 --> 09:16.840
You've got guts.

09:16.919 --> 09:18.279
Miss Xie has the brains.

09:18.519 --> 09:19.720
Once you're in Yongning Prefecture,

09:19.720 --> 09:21.879
if you need anything, tell Master Zhao.

09:22.320 --> 09:23.799
Solve this case,

09:23.960 --> 09:25.720
and you'll both be highly rewarded.

09:36.159 --> 09:37.120
I...

09:38.200 --> 09:39.000
I...

09:39.399 --> 09:41.000
- will do everything I can.
- will do everything I can.

09:49.000 --> 09:51.399
I need access to the officials' wives
in Yongning.

09:51.559 --> 09:52.919
For that, I need a respectable identity.

09:53.360 --> 09:55.159
If you're truly willing to help,

09:55.399 --> 09:56.639
tell them

09:56.639 --> 09:57.960
I'm a distant relative of yours

09:58.279 --> 09:59.559
and vouch for me.

10:01.480 --> 10:03.080
The Snow Salt Ballad
belongs to Zhao Ling.

10:03.320 --> 10:04.679
The connections are mine.

10:05.200 --> 10:06.960
You bring nothing
but your silver tongue,

10:07.159 --> 10:08.399
yet when this is over,

10:09.080 --> 10:10.320
you expect the lion's share
of the credit?

10:12.600 --> 10:13.960
Your position makes it difficult

10:14.279 --> 10:15.919
for you to show your face.

10:16.759 --> 10:18.360
If you wish to sit at my table,

10:19.200 --> 10:20.320
either obey my will,

10:20.679 --> 10:21.480
or

10:22.399 --> 10:23.360
take your leave.

10:27.120 --> 10:28.759
You, I can understand.

10:28.759 --> 10:30.320
But who is Zhao Ling?

10:30.840 --> 10:32.759
Who is he to bargain with me?

10:33.519 --> 10:34.919
What I don't understand

10:35.159 --> 10:37.480
is why you'd choose him over me.

10:37.720 --> 10:38.480
Madam,

10:39.519 --> 10:41.799
if you're so busy protecting
what you bring to the table

10:41.919 --> 10:43.879
that you can't see anyone else's value,

10:44.399 --> 10:45.519
I'm afraid

10:46.200 --> 10:48.360
you'll end up
exactly like my grandmother.

10:49.159 --> 10:51.919
Whether you take that seat is up to you.

10:56.039 --> 10:58.600
The Commissioner of the Western Capital
Salt Transport Bureau is named Yan.

10:59.120 --> 11:00.919
He's the one
behind the salt permit racket.

11:01.320 --> 11:02.399
The actual deals

11:02.600 --> 11:04.720
are handled by his wife, Madam Yan.

11:06.200 --> 11:07.440
Sounds like she's

11:07.639 --> 11:09.440
our way into this case.

11:10.399 --> 11:11.960
I know the salt trade inside and out.

11:12.159 --> 11:13.159
If I have to,

11:13.519 --> 11:15.120
I can pose as a salt merchant
from Jiangnan

11:15.519 --> 11:16.600
and approach her about
buying salt permits.

11:16.919 --> 11:17.759
That should draw her in.

11:18.879 --> 11:20.879
I'll start with the circle
of officials' wives

11:22.200 --> 11:23.360
and coordinate with Mr. Zhao.

11:25.240 --> 11:27.000
I've lived in Yongning for years.

11:27.440 --> 11:29.799
I know the officials' families
and all their connections.

11:30.200 --> 11:31.960
I can make the introductions

11:32.519 --> 11:35.240
and get the Ninth Young Lady inside.

11:37.159 --> 11:39.080
That covers every angle.

11:39.399 --> 11:40.399
Much appreciated, Madam.

11:45.360 --> 11:46.200
Blankets!

11:46.399 --> 11:48.039
(Yongning Prefecture)
Tight stitching, nice and thick!

11:48.279 --> 11:49.000
Come take a look!

11:52.159 --> 11:52.799
Miss,

11:53.159 --> 11:55.480
have you been to Yongning before?

11:56.039 --> 11:57.799
Once, when I was little.
I came with my mother.

11:58.600 --> 12:01.519
Tea parties, cards, the opera...

12:02.000 --> 12:04.279
The ladies in these circles
love them all.

12:04.679 --> 12:06.759
No wonder everyone wants
a life like theirs.

12:07.799 --> 12:09.039
It's not all for fun.

12:09.240 --> 12:10.919
There's another game
being played underneath.

12:11.720 --> 12:14.320
The husbands conduct official business,

12:14.440 --> 12:15.519
and some things

12:16.159 --> 12:17.480
can't be said out in the open.

12:17.559 --> 12:20.720
So their wives use these gatherings
to meet in private

12:21.159 --> 12:22.480
and trade information.

12:23.039 --> 12:24.120
At a gathering like that,

12:24.120 --> 12:25.480
you can't let your guard down
for a second.

12:26.080 --> 12:27.679
Miss one look,

12:27.919 --> 12:29.519
or fail to read one remark,

12:30.639 --> 12:32.039
and we could ruin the whole thing.

12:47.680 --> 12:50.640
(Xie Residence)

12:53.080 --> 12:53.960
The Sixteenth Master

12:54.279 --> 12:55.440
arranged the house.

12:56.399 --> 12:57.120
Get some rest.

12:57.240 --> 12:58.000
I've got something to take care of.

12:58.720 --> 12:59.519
Where are you going?

13:01.720 --> 13:03.840
(Tea)

14:04.000 --> 14:04.919
Fight's over.

14:05.360 --> 14:06.360
So who's this guy?

14:08.320 --> 14:09.440
Caught myself a traitor.

14:10.039 --> 14:11.159
I'll question him myself.

14:11.159 --> 14:12.679
No need for either of you to bother.

14:18.360 --> 14:20.440
I want to take over
Jiuweijiao's operation.

14:21.600 --> 14:22.759
You were his trusted confidant.

14:23.799 --> 14:24.600
You're the only one

14:25.480 --> 14:26.480
who can help me.

14:26.799 --> 14:28.759
You really have no shame, do you?

14:30.960 --> 14:33.080
If I can't have Jiuweijiao's operation,

14:33.679 --> 14:35.720
then this token is useless to me.

14:47.440 --> 14:49.360
But it seems to mean a lot to you,
doesn't it?

14:58.080 --> 14:58.919
Don't burn it!

15:22.240 --> 15:24.279
Now you've got another chance.

15:27.360 --> 15:28.200
So?

15:40.120 --> 15:42.120
(Well Salt. Mahuachi)

15:43.320 --> 15:44.000
The salt warehouse.

15:45.159 --> 15:45.840
So, there are

15:46.200 --> 15:47.600
thirty thousand catties of salt here.

15:48.120 --> 15:49.240
All top-grade.

15:50.159 --> 15:51.440
And there are several more warehouses

15:51.879 --> 15:52.799
just like this one.

15:57.360 --> 15:57.960
Mr. Zhao.

15:57.960 --> 15:59.200
The men are already in place.

15:59.480 --> 16:00.360
Same rules as before.

16:00.919 --> 16:01.960
They answer to you now.

16:04.759 --> 16:06.000
The boats are mine?

16:07.200 --> 16:08.480
The docks are mine too?

16:08.679 --> 16:10.600
They're Jiuweijiao's.

16:16.799 --> 16:18.120
Jiuweijiao's goods,

16:18.559 --> 16:19.360
warehouses,

16:20.039 --> 16:21.600
shops and shipping routes

16:21.600 --> 16:23.159
are all in your hands now.

16:23.879 --> 16:25.679
Why does this token matter
so much to you?

16:26.279 --> 16:27.480
Because it'll help me

16:27.480 --> 16:28.360
find my mother.

16:32.039 --> 16:33.440
I got what I wanted.

16:34.679 --> 16:36.200
Now you should get what you want.

16:47.879 --> 16:48.960
Back then,

16:49.399 --> 16:51.720
I only agreed to work for Jiuweijiao
for three years.

16:52.320 --> 16:53.320
But then

16:53.919 --> 16:55.279
he took my mother hostage.

16:57.639 --> 16:58.600
That's how

16:58.600 --> 17:00.639
he kept me working for him
all these years.

17:02.080 --> 17:03.159
Enough about that.

17:03.240 --> 17:04.799
Thank you for helping me find my mother.

17:06.440 --> 17:09.000
I, Yang Yucheng,
will serve you for three years

17:09.200 --> 17:10.119
without taking a single coin.

17:11.559 --> 17:12.359
Enough.

17:13.759 --> 17:15.240
Once we're done in Yongning,

17:15.440 --> 17:16.440
you're free to leave whenever you want.

17:18.000 --> 17:19.279
When Mr. Zhao

17:19.680 --> 17:22.680
risked his life to save me
at Biyun Nunnery,

17:23.039 --> 17:24.000
I knew then

17:25.720 --> 17:27.640
that he was a man of honor.

17:33.880 --> 17:35.759
That's why he's different
from Jiuweijiao.

17:37.039 --> 17:39.359
He'd never hold a man's mother hostage
to control him.

17:40.519 --> 17:42.079
Yucheng, don't worry.

17:42.480 --> 17:44.400
You can trust Mr. Zhao.

17:45.359 --> 17:46.839
As for your mother,

17:47.400 --> 17:49.440
I'll have Sanniang
take good care of her.

17:49.720 --> 17:50.640
Thank you, Miss.

17:53.359 --> 17:54.359
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

17:54.960 --> 17:57.000
(Mother.)

17:57.000 --> 17:58.359
(Mother, I hope you're well.)

17:59.759 --> 18:01.079
(It has been over a month
since I left home.)

18:01.400 --> 18:03.160
(I've now reached Yongning Prefecture.)

18:04.920 --> 18:06.960
(At the Fu Residence,
I lived in comfort)

18:07.319 --> 18:08.839
(and knew nothing of real hardship.)

18:09.359 --> 18:10.640
(After all that's happened,)

18:10.920 --> 18:12.720
(this journey has forced me
to reflect on myself.)

18:13.240 --> 18:14.440
(And I still refuse to accept my fate.)

18:17.119 --> 18:19.000
(I know how deeply you love me)

18:19.279 --> 18:20.680
(and want me to return to the capital.)

18:21.559 --> 18:23.279
(But I don't want merely to survive.)

18:23.839 --> 18:27.160
(Not everyone in this world
has a family to shelter them.)

18:28.279 --> 18:29.839
(I want to rely on myself)

18:30.839 --> 18:32.480
(and make a life of my own.)

18:39.200 --> 18:40.920
This little corner of the world

18:41.240 --> 18:42.960
could never hold you forever.

18:44.920 --> 18:46.720
Thanks to the Sixteenth Master's help,

18:46.839 --> 18:48.160
Jiuweijiao's stockpiles, shipping routes

18:48.160 --> 18:50.200
and men in Yongning

18:50.440 --> 18:51.759
all belong to Zhao Ling now.

18:52.519 --> 18:53.680
Then it's time

18:53.960 --> 18:55.799
we paid Madam Yan a visit.

18:59.320 --> 19:00.400
(Madam Yan, Wife of the Commissioner
of the Western Capital Salt Bureau)

19:00.400 --> 19:02.559
Your name is Jin Yuanbao?

19:02.720 --> 19:03.359
Yes.

19:04.200 --> 19:04.960
What a coincidence.

19:05.720 --> 19:07.000
Just last night,

19:07.240 --> 19:09.680
I happened to dream of a gold ingot,
like your name.

19:09.839 --> 19:11.920
(Madam Yan made a fortune
interpreting dreams.)

19:12.519 --> 19:14.119
(Whatever she dreamed of at night,)

19:14.200 --> 19:15.279
(salt merchants had to bring her)

19:15.279 --> 19:16.720
(the exact same thing)

19:16.720 --> 19:17.160
Madam.

19:17.160 --> 19:18.400
(to buy salt permits.)

19:19.319 --> 19:21.880
I had a craftsman make it
especially for you.

19:22.480 --> 19:23.920
Solid gold.

19:23.960 --> 19:26.200
The ingot in my dream

19:26.200 --> 19:27.440
was rather unusual.

19:27.920 --> 19:30.559
It was set with the Eight Treasures.

19:32.599 --> 19:33.279
Eight Treasures?

19:36.319 --> 19:37.920
Rubies and emeralds,

19:38.279 --> 19:39.920
blood amber from the Western Regions,

19:40.119 --> 19:41.799
Hotan mutton-fat jade...

19:41.799 --> 19:42.920
Eight kinds in all.

19:42.920 --> 19:44.160
Those are the Eight Treasures.

19:44.440 --> 19:45.519
Remarkable.

19:46.519 --> 19:48.319
It's exactly what I saw in my dream.

19:48.559 --> 19:50.119
Not a single detail is off.

19:54.760 --> 19:56.720
(Notes on Salt Administration, Volume I)

19:59.359 --> 20:01.039
These are the funds the Sixteenth Master
approved.

20:01.640 --> 20:02.480
Will this be enough?

20:06.960 --> 20:09.200
What do you need all that money for?

20:09.200 --> 20:10.480
Madam Yu can get you

20:10.480 --> 20:12.279
into Yongning's circle
of officials' wives.

20:12.680 --> 20:13.960
But if we want this to work,

20:14.319 --> 20:16.960
we need to play on Madam Yan's greed.

20:17.640 --> 20:19.160
So first, we make a splash.

20:19.279 --> 20:20.000
Get people talking.

20:20.000 --> 20:21.000
Enough to make Madam Yan

20:21.799 --> 20:23.359
tell you exactly what she dreamed about.

20:30.880 --> 20:32.079
Then, Mr. Zhao,

20:32.240 --> 20:35.400
you'll have to learn
how a real salt tycoon carries himself.

20:36.160 --> 20:37.480
Don't give yourself away.

20:39.319 --> 20:40.240
Then I suppose

20:42.079 --> 20:43.119
you could teach me.

20:50.279 --> 20:52.039
People of means

20:52.039 --> 20:53.720
drink only the first infusion.

20:54.200 --> 20:55.559
True wealth

20:56.079 --> 20:58.759
is all about making it look effortless.

21:00.319 --> 21:01.039
Try it.

21:51.359 --> 21:53.400
When you shop, never ask the price.

21:54.119 --> 21:56.119
Choose only what few others can have.

21:57.279 --> 21:58.960
Madam Yan has expensive tastes.

21:59.119 --> 22:01.640
Ordinary things won't impress her.

22:02.599 --> 22:03.480
Remember.

22:04.039 --> 22:05.160
When you raise your cup,

22:05.279 --> 22:06.240
keep your wrist steady.

22:06.400 --> 22:08.559
- See good things? Be unimpressed.
- Keep it steady.

22:08.559 --> 22:09.319
Be unimpressed.

22:09.319 --> 22:11.119
Even if you're only after money,

22:11.319 --> 22:14.440
you still have to make it
seem like you have refined taste.

22:16.440 --> 22:18.039
Maybe you should just show me
how it's done.

22:18.880 --> 22:21.279
I'm nothing compared to those
who are truly great.

22:23.200 --> 22:24.400
The one you should be studying

22:25.039 --> 22:26.000
is him.

22:34.520 --> 22:36.600
(The People Are the Foundation
of the State)

22:51.920 --> 22:54.080
(The People Are the Foundation
of the State)

22:58.160 --> 22:59.359
This inkstone

22:59.759 --> 23:00.839
is so coarse it'll ruin a brush.

23:02.759 --> 23:05.240
The ink it produces is muddy too.

23:07.119 --> 23:08.359
You call this an inkstone?

23:08.799 --> 23:09.799
Please don't be angry, sir.

23:09.960 --> 23:12.240
This is the finest Duan inkstone
we have.

23:12.480 --> 23:13.200
A Duan inkstone?

23:17.039 --> 23:18.200
The stone is porous,

23:19.279 --> 23:20.400
and it sounds dull when tapped.

23:22.240 --> 23:23.519
I want a greenstone inkstone,

23:24.119 --> 23:25.519
preferably with gold-thread veining.

23:25.799 --> 23:26.880
The stone should be smooth and lustrous,

23:27.319 --> 23:29.119
and ring clear when tapped.

23:29.599 --> 23:31.200
You have an excellent eye, sir.

23:31.599 --> 23:34.839
We do have
an heirloom greenstone inkstone.

23:34.839 --> 23:35.480
It's just...

23:35.480 --> 23:36.279
Bring it out.

23:36.440 --> 23:39.480
That inkstone costs five thousand taels.

23:43.640 --> 23:45.440
When Mr. Zhao buys something,

23:45.440 --> 23:46.359
he doesn't ask the price.

23:48.160 --> 23:48.720
Go get it.

23:48.720 --> 23:49.680
- Right away!
- Five thousand taels.

23:50.559 --> 23:52.440
Who exactly is this Mr. Zhao?

23:52.839 --> 23:54.559
What's he doing in Yongning?

24:03.040 --> 24:04.200
(Jinxiu Cloth Shop)

24:11.839 --> 24:12.759
Mr. Zhao.

24:14.720 --> 24:15.839
Miss Xie had a new outfit made

24:15.839 --> 24:16.680
and sent me to pick it up.

24:16.680 --> 24:18.200
Look. It's pretty nice.

24:19.720 --> 24:20.559
Nice fabric.

24:20.880 --> 24:22.319
You have a good eye, Mr. Zhao.

24:22.319 --> 24:23.920
This Huzhou silk just came in.

24:23.920 --> 24:24.759
It's nothing particularly rare,

24:24.759 --> 24:25.799
but the workmanship is excellent.

24:25.799 --> 24:26.880
A fine match for the young lady.

24:28.799 --> 24:29.960
How much more do you have?

24:30.200 --> 24:31.160
I'll take all of it.

24:31.279 --> 24:33.039
For a single outfit,

24:33.039 --> 24:34.720
one bolt is more than enough.

24:34.799 --> 24:36.480
You really don't need that much,
Mr. Zhao.

24:37.319 --> 24:38.720
I don't mean just your shop.

24:39.440 --> 24:41.079
Every bolt of Huzhou silk
in this city...

24:41.200 --> 24:42.359
bring it all to me.

24:42.799 --> 24:44.680
If Miss Xie wants to wear it,

24:45.319 --> 24:46.559
then no one else gets to.

24:48.640 --> 24:49.880
Impressive, Mr. Zhao.

24:49.880 --> 24:51.039
Quite a grand gesture.

25:01.599 --> 25:04.160
Huzhou silk isn't especially rare,

25:04.559 --> 25:07.119
but now I'm the only woman in the city
who can wear it.

25:07.480 --> 25:10.559
That makes it more exclusive
than gold or silver thread.

25:14.200 --> 25:15.519
(Mr. Zhao learns fast.)

25:15.720 --> 25:17.440
(He's already figured out how to take it
one step further.)

25:18.000 --> 25:19.240
(I underestimated him.)

25:20.799 --> 25:22.960
(Mr. Zhao really spends money
like water.)

25:23.680 --> 25:24.559
(He sure does.)

25:24.720 --> 25:26.720
(He drops thousands of taels
without blinking.)

25:26.720 --> 25:27.680
(Exactly.)

25:27.680 --> 25:29.680
(He throws around a fortune
like it's nothing.)

25:30.079 --> 25:30.920
Master Zhao,

25:31.200 --> 25:32.000
I really

25:32.079 --> 25:33.960
can't figure out

25:33.960 --> 25:35.240
what exactly he's up to.

25:35.599 --> 25:37.240
He's burning through money
like there's no tomorrow.

25:37.440 --> 25:38.519
What if

25:38.839 --> 25:40.279
this whole thing falls through

25:40.279 --> 25:41.240
and we lose the money too?

25:41.720 --> 25:42.640
Then what?

25:45.720 --> 25:46.799
We chose to trust him.

25:47.720 --> 25:48.799
Let's keep watching

25:48.880 --> 25:50.559
and see what he's really planning.

25:59.519 --> 26:02.400
Madam Yu asked me
to pass along a message.

26:03.480 --> 26:04.640
The road ahead is narrow.

26:04.880 --> 26:06.240
She asks that you go first.

26:09.759 --> 26:11.880
Madam Yu. It's been a long time.

26:12.599 --> 26:13.759
It has indeed.

26:14.680 --> 26:15.880
And this is...?

26:16.480 --> 26:17.920
This is Miss Xie.

26:18.359 --> 26:20.799
She's a close friend
of my future daughter-in-law.

26:21.319 --> 26:23.079
Madam Yan's birthday banquet
is in a few days.

26:23.079 --> 26:24.400
I'm afraid I won't be able to attend,

26:24.519 --> 26:26.000
so I'm sending these two young ladies

26:26.000 --> 26:27.599
to deliver a small gift on my behalf.

26:28.480 --> 26:29.640
Thank you, Madam Yu.

26:40.160 --> 26:41.200
In a few days,

26:41.400 --> 26:43.599
Madam Yan,
the Salt Transport Commissioner's wife,

26:43.599 --> 26:44.920
is holding her birthday banquet.

26:45.079 --> 26:47.160
She's invited the ladies
of all the prominent families.

26:47.279 --> 26:49.519
I'll be busy entertaining
an important guest

26:49.519 --> 26:50.680
and won't be able to go myself.

26:52.079 --> 26:53.400
You'll go in my place.

26:53.480 --> 26:55.119
It'll broaden your horizons.

26:57.960 --> 26:58.640
(Invitation)

26:58.640 --> 26:59.400
Yes, Madam.

27:00.279 --> 27:03.000
Thank you for the introduction, Madam.

27:03.920 --> 27:05.559
But when you go,

27:06.720 --> 27:08.160
you'll need to take someone with you.

27:09.920 --> 27:11.039
Fu Tingyun.

27:13.839 --> 27:14.960
In public,

27:14.960 --> 27:16.519
just call her Miss Xie.

27:18.799 --> 27:21.519
Fu Tingyun knows how a proper young lady
should carry herself in these circles.

27:21.839 --> 27:24.000
She learned it all from Old Madam Fu.

27:24.079 --> 27:26.359
You're bright and even-tempered.

27:26.599 --> 27:29.319
Stay close to me. Watch and learn.

27:29.680 --> 27:31.039
You won't be any less capable
than she is.

27:32.319 --> 27:33.880
A river does not seek to be first.

27:33.960 --> 27:35.400
It triumphs by never stopping its flow.

27:36.640 --> 27:38.799
This is the first lesson I teach you.

27:39.960 --> 27:41.240
Remember it well.

27:44.279 --> 27:44.960
Yes, Madam.

27:48.640 --> 27:49.400
Go.

28:00.319 --> 28:01.079
Madam,

28:01.319 --> 28:03.119
have you really accepted Miss Fan?

28:04.000 --> 28:05.279
What's done is done.

28:06.559 --> 28:08.839
Since we've decided to welcome her
into the family,

28:09.240 --> 28:11.319
she'll have to shoulder her share
of the responsibilities.

28:12.720 --> 28:14.160
I'll rein in my temper from now on

28:14.160 --> 28:15.319
and let bygones be bygones.

28:16.640 --> 28:18.640
Let's see how well

28:18.960 --> 28:20.799
she plays the hand she's been dealt.

28:23.920 --> 28:25.640
I really got on her bad side.

28:25.920 --> 28:27.559
She hasn't punished me outright,

28:28.000 --> 28:29.599
but she's using others to put me
in my place.

28:29.720 --> 28:32.240
Today she paraded Fu Tingyun
all over town.

28:32.880 --> 28:34.039
Anyone who didn't know better

28:34.039 --> 28:35.799
would think Fu Tingyun
was her future daughter-in-law.

28:36.079 --> 28:37.559
Don't worry, Miss Fan.

28:37.839 --> 28:39.960
You're marrying
into the prestigious Yu family.

28:40.119 --> 28:41.799
You'll be the wife
of a future Grand Secretary.

28:42.079 --> 28:43.000
As for the Ninth Young Lady,

28:43.000 --> 28:45.400
all she can do is run around
with some shady salt smuggler.

28:45.480 --> 28:47.279
That's as far as she'll ever get.

28:47.880 --> 28:49.039
You're right.

28:51.000 --> 28:53.119
I'm the lady Madam Yu chose herself.

28:53.440 --> 28:55.279
The more something matters to Madam Yu,

28:55.640 --> 28:56.680
the more I have to get it right.

28:57.440 --> 28:59.839
How much silver do we have left?

29:00.359 --> 29:01.960
Less than a hundred taels.

29:03.759 --> 29:04.720
A hundred taels...

29:06.160 --> 29:08.279
(Commentaries on the Four Books)
These old books my father left me

29:08.519 --> 29:09.680
are rare and valuable.

29:10.000 --> 29:11.319
You can hardly find them anywhere,

29:11.880 --> 29:13.400
and they contain his handwritten notes.

29:14.759 --> 29:16.000
If I sell them,

29:16.400 --> 29:17.920
they'll fetch a good amount of silver.

29:18.400 --> 29:19.240
Miss Fan,

29:19.559 --> 29:20.519
these books

29:20.599 --> 29:22.640
were part of the dowry
your father left you.

29:23.440 --> 29:24.480
And since they're my dowry,

29:25.279 --> 29:26.519
I can do with them as I please.

29:27.000 --> 29:28.519
There are ten chests in all.

29:29.359 --> 29:30.440
Losing three

29:31.240 --> 29:32.119
won't matter.

29:32.519 --> 29:34.119
But if my birthday gift
isn't impressive enough

29:34.599 --> 29:35.519
and I lose face,

29:36.240 --> 29:37.720
I'll never get it back.

29:37.720 --> 29:38.799
Miss Fan...

29:41.520 --> 29:43.320
(Invitation)

29:52.480 --> 29:53.240
Mr. Zhao.

29:55.079 --> 29:57.680
Miss Xie's trying to decide
on a birthday gift.

29:59.759 --> 30:00.720
What's this?

30:01.759 --> 30:03.000
Something rare.

30:03.079 --> 30:04.119
Wasn't easy to get.

30:04.960 --> 30:06.039
Cook it properly.

30:06.240 --> 30:07.680
Give her a little treat.

30:08.759 --> 30:09.759
I'll go steam it.

30:16.680 --> 30:18.279
Still trying to figure out

30:19.480 --> 30:20.599
what to give Madam Yan?

30:22.759 --> 30:24.839
I've prepared some expensive gifts,

30:26.079 --> 30:27.440
but I'm worried

30:27.640 --> 30:29.839
none of them will truly impress her.

30:30.160 --> 30:33.519
I'd hate to waste all the attention
you've built up for us.

30:34.519 --> 30:35.759
(Invitation)
Are you short on money?

30:35.960 --> 30:37.039
We could go to the market

30:37.279 --> 30:38.480
first thing tomorrow.

30:40.759 --> 30:41.920
I'm not worried

30:42.440 --> 30:43.720
that it isn't expensive enough.

30:45.559 --> 30:46.960
I'm worried it isn't unique enough.

30:47.519 --> 30:49.160
It has to be something

30:49.519 --> 30:51.519
no one but us could possibly give her.

30:52.400 --> 30:54.960
That's how we show
what we're capable of.

30:55.039 --> 30:56.559
On the surface, it's a birthday gift.

30:56.960 --> 30:59.119
But really, it's meant to make
people wonder how deep our pockets go.

31:07.160 --> 31:08.759
I've already had dinner.

31:09.359 --> 31:11.000
Why is Sanniang cooking again?

31:11.000 --> 31:13.039
I just took over
Jiuweijiao's shipping routes.

31:15.119 --> 31:16.680
I got you something fresh to try.

31:20.799 --> 31:21.480
(I've got it!)

31:25.680 --> 31:27.920
(Yan Residence)

31:31.320 --> 31:33.840
(Tian Wanyi, Daughter
of Grand Secretary Tian)

31:38.559 --> 31:39.759
Careful with him.

31:39.759 --> 31:40.920
This little beast of mine

31:40.920 --> 31:42.279
won't sit on anything but brocade.

31:42.279 --> 31:43.319
Is everything ready?

31:43.319 --> 31:44.200
Yes, Madam Wei.

31:44.200 --> 31:45.279
Everything's ready.

31:45.400 --> 31:47.119
Madam Wei, you certainly know
how to make an entrance.

31:47.519 --> 31:49.599
I hear Lord Wei has an excellent record.

31:49.680 --> 31:51.000
Once his performance review is over,

31:51.000 --> 31:52.680
you'll be moving up to the capital.

31:52.799 --> 31:54.599
No wonder you're positively glowing.

31:55.960 --> 31:57.480
What good fortune?

31:57.680 --> 31:59.160
More like bad luck.

31:59.480 --> 32:01.640
What married couple wants to live apart?

32:01.880 --> 32:02.640
Quite right.

32:23.200 --> 32:23.960
Tingyun.

32:24.400 --> 32:25.079
Yake.

32:27.120 --> 32:30.000
(Lanyun Pavilion)

32:37.119 --> 32:37.920
Tingyun,

32:38.599 --> 32:39.839
given your low standing,

32:40.119 --> 32:41.119
you should wait here for now.

32:41.720 --> 32:43.279
I'll find the right moment

32:44.200 --> 32:45.680
to introduce you to the ladies.

32:50.200 --> 32:52.880
Miss Fan, daughter of Master Fan,
has arrived.

32:53.920 --> 32:55.359
So that's Miss Fan.

32:55.359 --> 32:56.240
She certainly carries herself well.

32:56.240 --> 32:58.119
She does. Just look at her.

33:01.960 --> 33:03.200
Greetings, Madam Yan.

33:04.920 --> 33:06.640
Madam Wei, you know everyone here.

33:06.839 --> 33:08.680
Why don't you make the introductions?

33:08.680 --> 33:11.000
This young lady is quite something.

33:11.000 --> 33:12.640
Her father is a renowned scholar,

33:12.640 --> 33:14.359
Master Fan Kun.

33:15.000 --> 33:17.160
Young Master Yu of the Yu family
here in Yongning

33:17.240 --> 33:19.559
is one of Master Fan's finest students.

33:19.640 --> 33:22.119
The two families
arranged their marriage long ago.

33:22.119 --> 33:24.720
So she's Madam Yu's
future daughter-in-law?

33:24.880 --> 33:27.359
If Madam Yu chose her herself,

33:27.559 --> 33:29.559
she must be the cream of the crop.

33:29.559 --> 33:30.400
Indeed.

33:30.400 --> 33:31.359
I'm here today

33:31.839 --> 33:33.400
on Madam Yu's behalf.

33:35.519 --> 33:37.119
I've brought you an incense burner.

33:37.759 --> 33:40.039
It's gilt-brass, begonia-shaped.

33:40.599 --> 33:41.920
I hope

33:42.279 --> 33:43.640
it's to your liking.

33:47.400 --> 33:49.839
Have incense burners suddenly

33:50.079 --> 33:51.759
become all the rage in Yongning?

33:51.880 --> 33:53.319
Not just incense burners.

33:53.440 --> 33:55.000
Incense, spices...

33:55.119 --> 33:56.920
Madam Yan has received
several of each already.

33:57.240 --> 33:58.160
But that's all right.

33:58.319 --> 33:59.400
A few more sets

33:59.400 --> 34:01.160
and she'll have one for every room.

34:04.799 --> 34:06.480
So the gifts happened to overlap.

34:06.559 --> 34:08.920
It's the thought that counts,

34:08.920 --> 34:09.679
isn't it?

34:10.039 --> 34:12.000
Yes. The thought.

34:18.039 --> 34:20.360
May I introduce someone

34:20.880 --> 34:22.039
to you ladies?

34:25.599 --> 34:26.559
Her name is Xie.

34:26.880 --> 34:28.639
We've been close friends
since childhood.

34:28.840 --> 34:32.000
Her fiance has quite a head
for business.

34:34.519 --> 34:37.119
Aren't you the one
with all that Huzhou silk?

34:37.800 --> 34:38.960
Huzhou silk?

34:39.119 --> 34:40.360
This young lady

34:40.360 --> 34:41.960
has been the talk of the town lately.

34:41.960 --> 34:43.079
Is your fiance

34:43.400 --> 34:44.519
surnamed Zhao?

34:45.239 --> 34:47.199
Mr. Zhao.

34:49.039 --> 34:50.280
That explains it.

34:53.840 --> 34:55.719
My friend only just arrived in Yongning.

34:56.159 --> 34:57.199
She came in such a hurry

34:57.440 --> 34:58.559
that she had no time
to prepare a birthday gift.

34:59.039 --> 35:01.280
I hope you won't hold it against her,
Madam.

35:02.000 --> 35:03.440
No need to worry, Miss Fan.

35:04.360 --> 35:05.679
I did prepare a gift.

35:06.360 --> 35:07.199
That's right.

35:07.480 --> 35:08.920
The matron mentioned

35:09.559 --> 35:10.840
one of today's dishes

35:11.039 --> 35:13.239
was Miss Xie's birthday gift.

35:19.840 --> 35:21.920
(Longevity)
Miss Xie,

35:22.639 --> 35:23.840
I can't quite tell

35:24.000 --> 35:25.480
which of these dishes is your gift.

35:26.559 --> 35:27.679
Do tell.

35:28.039 --> 35:29.440
We'd love to know.

35:30.360 --> 35:31.559
Miss Fan,

35:31.559 --> 35:33.679
Miss Xie's gift is quite exceptional,

35:33.800 --> 35:35.559
so we've made it today's main course.

35:35.559 --> 35:36.519
It'll be served at once.

35:36.840 --> 35:37.840
Miss Xie,

35:37.960 --> 35:39.119
tell me.

35:39.119 --> 35:40.039
What is it?

35:40.159 --> 35:41.719
It is fairly well known,

35:42.000 --> 35:44.559
but it's nothing terribly expensive.

35:44.719 --> 35:46.880
Just something fresh for you ladies
to enjoy.

35:48.639 --> 35:50.360
These are Huajin crabs
from the Lianghuai salt region.

35:50.519 --> 35:53.000
Mr. Zhao had them
delivered straight to the kitchen

35:53.000 --> 35:54.199
while they were still alive.

35:55.000 --> 35:59.079
Huajin crab, Yangcheng crab
and Shengfang crab

35:59.199 --> 36:00.760
are known as the three finest crabs.

36:01.239 --> 36:03.320
But it is crab season right now.

36:03.639 --> 36:05.800
It's not as though we ladies
can't afford them,

36:06.039 --> 36:07.000
so they're hardly priceless.

36:07.400 --> 36:08.679
It's just that

36:08.800 --> 36:11.360
Lianghuai is a long way
from Yongning Prefecture.

36:12.239 --> 36:13.519
Just something fresh for you to taste.

36:14.079 --> 36:15.719
But that's exactly
what makes them special.

36:15.719 --> 36:18.280
Getting them here fresh
is the hard part.

36:18.280 --> 36:19.519
A person can survive
such a long journey,

36:19.519 --> 36:20.559
but

36:20.559 --> 36:22.679
how could the crabs possibly survive it?

36:24.159 --> 36:25.559
What's your secret?

36:25.559 --> 36:27.920
How did you get them here
alive and fresh?

36:28.239 --> 36:29.440
There's no secret.

36:29.519 --> 36:30.920
You simply ship enough of them.

36:30.920 --> 36:32.880
If a hundred baskets aren't enough,
send a thousand.

36:33.119 --> 36:35.199
If that's still not enough,
dedicate an entire boat to them.

36:35.199 --> 36:36.719
Then surely enough will survive

36:36.719 --> 36:37.840
for you ladies to enjoy.

36:38.440 --> 36:41.079
The Yellow River is treacherous.
Shipping isn't easy.

36:41.679 --> 36:43.119
Who handled the shipment for you?

36:43.119 --> 36:44.280
They must be very capable.

36:45.920 --> 36:46.960
Mr. Zhao

36:47.920 --> 36:49.599
happens to be a salt merchant
from Lianghuai.

36:52.039 --> 36:53.639
So you used the salt routes.

36:54.079 --> 36:56.079
No wonder these crabs are so special.

36:56.639 --> 36:58.079
How thoughtful of you, Miss Xie.

36:58.800 --> 37:00.159
Though I hear

37:00.440 --> 37:02.320
the salt trade runs smoothly
in Lianghuai.

37:02.320 --> 37:03.719
Here in Yongning,

37:03.719 --> 37:04.960
people have to open new channels.

37:05.920 --> 37:07.119
We're new to Yongning.

37:07.119 --> 37:08.960
Going to the wrong people
could get us into real trouble.

37:09.199 --> 37:10.159
On that matter,

37:10.519 --> 37:12.519
I was hoping you might advise me,
Madam Yan.

37:14.400 --> 37:15.360
Me?

37:15.599 --> 37:17.880
I know plenty
about food and entertainment,

37:18.079 --> 37:20.079
but I know nothing about business.

37:21.599 --> 37:23.280
Let's eat the crabs. Come on.

37:23.920 --> 37:24.519
Of course.

37:29.880 --> 37:31.079
I hate the rain.

37:31.079 --> 37:32.559
It's gotten the hem of my dress filthy.

37:37.119 --> 37:38.840
Thank you both for your hospitality.

37:43.039 --> 37:43.960
Miss Xie.

38:00.480 --> 38:01.800
So that's her fiance?

38:01.800 --> 38:03.039
Mr. Zhao?

38:11.559 --> 38:12.079
Come.

38:13.119 --> 38:15.239
I didn't expect him
to be so young and successful.

38:15.400 --> 38:16.480
Indeed.

38:16.679 --> 38:17.719
And quite handsome too.

38:17.719 --> 38:18.760
He is.

38:18.840 --> 38:19.480
Please.

38:48.000 --> 38:48.480
Here.

38:59.559 --> 39:01.400
Mr. Zhao really does treat her well.

39:01.800 --> 39:03.039
Look at him. He's actually...

39:04.000 --> 39:04.920
Come on up.

39:05.480 --> 39:06.400
The longer we stand here,

39:07.119 --> 39:08.199
the more people will see us.

39:22.079 --> 39:23.440
No wonder they say

39:23.760 --> 39:25.800
marrying a good man

39:25.880 --> 39:27.719
is one of life's greatest blessings.

39:28.159 --> 39:29.840
People are talking.

39:29.840 --> 39:30.960
Lord Yan

39:31.119 --> 39:33.679
is over forty with no son,

39:33.679 --> 39:36.079
yet he refuses to take a concubine
for Madam Yan's sake.

39:36.840 --> 39:39.599
And now Mr. Zhao is holding
his lady's shoes with his own hands.

39:40.000 --> 39:41.679
Then I think of my husband

39:42.079 --> 39:43.639
and it makes my blood boil.

39:48.239 --> 39:50.119
You don't have to go this far.

39:52.199 --> 39:53.440
Wasn't the whole point today

39:54.679 --> 39:55.960
to get people talking?

39:58.960 --> 40:01.800
We've already put on enough of a show

40:02.199 --> 40:03.400
for everyone watching.

40:06.679 --> 40:07.559
What about you?

40:08.760 --> 40:10.320
Did she tell you
what she's been daydreaming about?

40:11.440 --> 40:13.000
I know what she wants now.

40:17.080 --> 40:19.560
(Next Episode)

40:20.400 --> 40:22.960
(I come from a lesser branch
of the Xie family in Jiangnan.)

40:23.199 --> 40:25.760
(We control some salt trading business.)

40:26.039 --> 40:27.880
(I'd like, on behalf of my fiance,
Mr. Zhao,)

40:28.480 --> 40:29.480
(to ask)

40:29.880 --> 40:30.920
(for a salt permit, Madam Yan.)

40:30.920 --> 40:33.280
She was already betrothed to me,

40:33.920 --> 40:37.440
and threw me over to chase
after an Imperial Envoy!

40:37.920 --> 40:38.800
For me,

40:38.960 --> 40:40.400
I hate being lied to more than anything.

40:40.880 --> 40:42.159
You came to do business with me,

40:42.519 --> 40:43.760
but hid who you really are.

40:44.880 --> 40:46.559
If you can't explain yourself today,

40:47.079 --> 40:48.679
I'll kill your man.

40:51.039 --> 40:51.760
Run.

40:52.440 --> 40:53.519
They're going to kill you.

41:05.440 --> 41:09.760
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

41:13.360 --> 41:17.720
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

41:19.840 --> 41:24.480
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

41:24.720 --> 41:27.520
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

41:28.680 --> 41:33.320
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

41:36.520 --> 41:43.360
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

41:44.240 --> 41:50.760
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

41:51.720 --> 41:55.160
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

41:55.680 --> 41:59.880
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

42:00.160 --> 42:05.840
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

42:17.960 --> 42:21.840
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

42:25.760 --> 42:29.760
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

42:31.480 --> 42:36.160
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

42:36.480 --> 42:39.160
♪Kept close within my heart♪

42:40.240 --> 42:45.080
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

42:48.600 --> 42:55.520
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

42:56.400 --> 43:02.880
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

43:03.760 --> 43:07.280
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

43:07.720 --> 43:12.080
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

43:12.280 --> 43:18.000
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
